{"title":"Dunehide Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher, Dune Marauder</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 30 · DEX 80 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (1 / 196 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dunehide-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-crude\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head?q=crude\">Crude <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/dunehide-head?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excelle