lls</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Crude ones</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dropped by</th><th>Qualities recorded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Sael Quickstring</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span> 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dunehide-head\" data-map-quality=\"crude\">Show where it drops Crude on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ee24cd14c85838124a1a.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/cfe3b115bd1a52814608.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b0a1dcb7a8a29c4f1ffd.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/thak-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/3ac35c611863522f1e9d.svg\" alt=\"\">Thak Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/leather-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ad0df36ce44572a810c0.svg\" alt=\"\">Leather Head</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/dragonhide-head\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/8aff54adaf9a41658e77.svg\" alt=\"\">Dragonhide Head</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic q-glow-crude\"><img src=\"data/img/1981696ba13bfd1bd890.svg\" alt=\"Dunehide Head\"><span id=\"gearEnchBadge\" class=\"wp-badge\"></span></div><h3>Duneh